# quest/014/BanIxa101_01494 — « Trust, but Verify» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※本クエストは、クラフタークラス：レベル1以上、<br>　バトルクラス：レベル41以上推奨です。 <br><br>エカトル実験場の職工のヤゼル・アファタンは、冒険者に火急の依頼があるようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※ Dieser Auftrag wird für Charaktere ab Stufe 41 als Krieger oder Magier und ab Stufe 1 als Handwerker empfohlen.<br><br>In Ehcatl hat Yazel Ahuatan einen dringenden Auftrag für dich.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>* <i>Avant de commencer cette quête, il est recommandé d'être au niveau 1 minimum pour les disciples de la main, et au niveau 41 minimum pour les disciples de la guerre et de la magie.</i><br><br>Yazel Ahuatan aimerait vous demander de faire quelque chose pour lui.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <ui-color 508> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 508 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Many would deign to call themselves able, but Yazel Ahuatan the Able goes so far as to claim it as his title.<br>※The crafting portion of this quest is recommended for Disciples of the Hand level 1 and above, and the battle portion for Disciples of War or Magic level 41 and above."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ※本クエストには「<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> レベルアジャスト」が、<br>　設定されています。<br><br>職工のヤゼル・アファタンから「<sheet Item "　8091" 0>」の製作を依頼された。ハーストミルの「アメッタ」に製作施設の使用許可をもらおう。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> Die Schwierigkeit des Auftrags wird an die aktuelle Stufe angepasst.<br><br>Yazel Ahuatan hat dich mit der Herstellung <noun-de Item 1 "　8091" 1 2 1> beauftragt. Bitte Dametta in Mühlenhain um Erlaubnis, ihre Arbeitsstätte nutzen zu dürfen.
#. fr: * <i>Cette quête est <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> synchronisée</ui-edge-color></ui-color> avec votre niveau.</i><br><br>Yazel Ahuatan vous a demandé de fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8091" 1 1>. Rendez-vous au Moulin des Bois pour demander à Dametta l'au<shy>to<shy>ri<shy>sa<shy>tion d'utiliser l'installation d'artisanat.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Questioning your skills as an artisan, Yazel Ahuatan invites you to prove him wrong by crafting a bladder component with the materials he has provided. His challenge is further complicated by the requirement that you use special facilities in Hyrstmill to craft the component─facilities which are administered by Dametta, a woman of some repute, who may not be amenable to your request.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作施設を使う条件として、アメッタから泥棒猿の討伐を頼まれた。エ・タッタ監視哨付近の「<sheet EObj 2004452 0>」に「<sheet EventItem 2001374 0>」を使い、「<sheet BNpcName 2984 0>」をおびき寄せて退治しよう。
#. de: Für die Nutzung ihrer Arbeitsstätte hat dir Dametta eine Bedingung gestellt. Benutze <noun-de EventItem 2 2001374 1 4 1> an <noun-de EObj 1 2004452 1 3 1> im Wald als Köder und besiege den so angelockten <noun-de BNpcName 5 2984 1 4 1>!
#. fr: Vous allez devoir abattre <noun-fr BNpcName 1 2984 1 1> avant de pouvoir vous servir de l'installation d'artisanat. Posez <noun-fr EventItem 1 2001374 1 1> sur le territoire d'un de ces singes près de la tour d'E-Tatt pour l'attirer puis réglez-lui son compte.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Dametta is willing to grant you permission to use her facilities─provided you carry out a simple task in exchange. A particularly persistent opo<hyphen>opo has been raiding her stores for some time, and she would have you permanently resolve the situation. With the aid of ripe Mun<hyphen>Tuy beans, lure the beastkin out from his lair near E<hyphen>Tatt's Spire and end his reign of terror once and for all. Alternatively, you could converse with the woman further and attempt to persuade her...but that approach may not end well."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 2984 0>を討伐した。ハーストミルの「アメッタ」に証拠の品「<sheet EventItem 2001375 0>」と「<sheet EventItem 2001373 0>」を渡し、製作施設の使用許可をもらおう。
#. de: Du hast Damettas Wunsch erfüllt. Bring ihr zum Beweis <noun-de EventItem 2 2001375 1 4 1> zusammen mit <noun-de EventItem 2 2001373 1 3 1>.
#. fr: Vous êtes venu<if $gn4>e</if> à bout <noun-fr BNpcName 9 2984 1 1>. Remettez <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001375 1 1> et <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001373 1 1> à Dametta afin qu'elle vous autorise à utiliser l'installation d'artisanat.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "The notorious bean thief is no more, and the claw you have extricated from its carcass should serve as ample proof. Present it and the bladder component materials to Dametta in Hyrstmill."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作施設の準備が整った。「<sheet Item "　8052" 0>」をもとに「<sheet Item "　8091" 0>」を製作し、エカトル実験場の「職工のヤゼル・アファタン」に納品しよう。<br><br>※バフステータス「製作施設：部材工作」が終了した場合や、「<sheet Item "　8052" 0>」を失った場合は、再びアメッタに話しかけましょう。バフステータスと材料が付与され、再挑戦が可能になります。
#. de: Dametta hat dir erlaubt, ihre Arbeitsstätte zu benutzen. Verarbeite <noun-de Item 2 "　8052" 1 4 1> zu <noun-de Item 1 "　8091" 1 3 1> und bringe es zu Yazel Ahuatan in Ehcatl.<br><br>※ Sollte der Status <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Arbeitsstätte: Herstellung</ui-edge-color></ui-color> enden oder <noun-de Item 2 "　8052" 1 1 1> verloren gehen, kannst du Dametta erneut um Hilfe bitten. Sie wird dir dann das Material und die Arbeitsstätte für einen neuen Versuch zur Verfügung stellen.
#. fr: Vous pouvez maintenant faire usage de l'installation d'artisanat. Servez-vous des matériaux pour fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8091" 1 1> et apportez-le à Yazel Ahuatan, au centre d'essais d'Ehcatl.<br>* <i>Adressez-vous de nouveau à Dametta si vous n'avez plus de matériaux ou si vous avez perdu l'effet Installation<nbsp>: production.</i>
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "The claw serves both to horrify Dametta's sensibilities and satisfy her requirements. With the materials provided to you by Yazel Ahuatan, synthesize a bladder component, and deliver it to him at Ehcatl.<br><br>※In the event that the status <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Facility Access: Production</ui-edge-color></ui-color> wears off or the synthesis ends in failure, you may try again by speaking with Dametta."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 職工のヤゼル・アファタンに<sheet Item "　8091" 0>を納品した。彼が仕事に打ち込む理由は、天涯孤独だった自分を育ててくれた親方に報いたいとの思いからだった。「デズル・クワラン号」の建造にたずさわる者たちは、それぞれの願いを込めて夢の飛空艇と向き合っているのだろう。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 "　8091" 1 4 1> bei Yazel Ahuatan abgeliefert. Ganz offensichtlich war er früher einsam und ausgestoßen, doch unter der Großen Schwinge hat er seine Bestimmung gefunden: den Traum vom Fliegen zu verwirklichen. Dafür arbeiten er und seine Stammesbrüdern eifrig an der <i>Dezul Qualan</i>.
#. fr: Lorsque vous lui avez remis <noun-fr Item 2 "　8091" 1 1>, Yazel Ahuatan vous a raconté son histoire. Il semble heureux de pouvoir enfin rendre service à Sezul Totoloc qui l'a jadis recueilli et sera cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment ravi si vous décidez d'apporter votre aide au projet des Planeurs d'Ehcatl.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_SEQ_05:1"
msgid "The most able of Ixal accepts your work with a mighty squa-hawk, satisfied with its quality. Within you he sees a great potential─one which he likens to his own, glimpsed by Chief Totoloc long ago. Weighty words indeed, one might say─though one must always consider the source, as well."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハーストミルのアメッタと話す
#. de: Mit Dametta in Mühlenhain sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Dametta
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Dametta."
msgstr ""

#. ja: エ・タッタ監視哨付近の<sheet EObj 2004452 0>に<sheet EventItem 2001374 0>を使い、<br>現れた<sheet BNpcName 2984 0>を討伐
#. de: An <noun-de EObj 1 2004452 1 3 1> <noun-de BNpcName 2 2984 1 4 1> anlocken und erlegen
#. fr: Placer <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001374 1 1> sur <noun-fr EObj 1 2004452 1 1>, près de la tour d'E-Tatt
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Use the ripe Mun<hyphen>Tuy beans to lure out the salivating simian."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハーストミルのアメッタに<sheet EventItem 2001375 0>と<sheet EventItem 2001373 0>を渡す
#. de: Dametta in Mühlenhain <noun-de EventItem 2 2001375 1 4 1> und <noun-de EventItem 2 2001373 1 4 1> geben
#. fr: Apporter <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001375 1 1> et <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001373 1 1> à Dametta
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Present the simian claw and the bladder component materials to Dametta."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($n1 < $n2)>製作手帳 友好部族クエストLv1：<sheet Item "　8091" 0>を製作<else>職工のヤゼル・アファタンに<sheet Item "　8091" 0>を納品</if>
#. de: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Handwerker-Notizbuch (Freundesvölker) St.1: <noun-de Item 1 "　8091" 1 4 1> herstellen<else>Yazel Ahuatan <noun-de Item 2 "　8091" 1 4 1> bringen</if>
#. fr: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8091" 1 1><else>Apporter <noun-fr Item 2 "　8091" 1 1> à Yazel Ahuatan</if>
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Synthesize a bladder component<else>Deliver the bladder component to Yazel Ahuatan the Able</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_TODO_03:1"
msgid "<if ($n1 < $n2)>Synthesize a bladder component<else>Deliver the bladder component to Yazel Ahuatan the Able</if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: お、おい、<if $gn4>ネエチャン<else>アンチャン</if>！<br>至急「<sheet Item "　8091" 0>」を作ってくれんかッァ！<br>材料はちゃんと用意してあるぞッォ！
#. de: Khaa, khaa! Federlose<if $gn4><else>r</if>, machst du mir <noun-de Item 1 "　8091" 1 4 1>? Geb ich dir Material dafür.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Celle-là<else>Celui-là</if>, <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if><nbsp>! <if $gn4>Elle<else>Il</if> ne pourrait pas fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8091" 1 1> pour celui-ci<nbsp>? C'est urgent<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_000:1"
msgid "Squahaha! An able crafter, featherless one is? Not so able as Yazel, I think! Yet prove me wrong, you may, and aid Ehcatl in so doing!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 作ってほしいのはッァ、ガス抜き用のバルブなんじゃッァ！<br>飛空艇の高度を下げたいときには、<br>気嚢からガスを抜かにゃあならんッン！
#. de: Und zwar brauchen ich ein Druckventil, verstehst du? Um Flughöhe zu senken, muss man Gas ablassen. Is' klar, khaa!
#. fr: En fait, celui-ci a besoin d'une valve qui servira à libérer du gaz des ballons pour faire perdre de l'altitude au Dezul Qualan.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_010:1"
msgid "An emergency release valve, for use with an airship bladder, we require! A simple task for a featherless one skilled as you, Yazel trusts."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 作ってほしいのはッァ、純度の高いなめし剤なんじゃッァ！<br>気嚢に使う皮革材をなめすのに、<br>どうしても必要なんじゃッァ！
#. de: Und zwar brauchen ich gutes Gerbmittel, verstehst du? Ballonhaut machen wir aus ganz dünnem Leder, khaa!
#. fr: En fait, celui-ci a besoin d'une solution très pure pour tanner la peau qui servira à con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner les ballons du Dezul Qualan.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_020:1"
msgid "Tanning agents for treating materials used to craft an airship bladder, we require! A simple task for a featherless one skilled as you, Yazel trusts."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 作ってほしいのはッァ、球皮材ってモンじゃッァ！<br>高々度の低い気圧にも耐えられる、<br>丈夫な気嚢を作るために必要なんじゃッァ！
#. de: Und zwar brauchen ich Stoff oder Leder für Ballonhülle, verstehst du? Großem Druck muss Hülle standhalten, sonst sie platzen und großes Unglück passieren, khaa!
#. fr: En fait, celui-ci a besoin d'un morceau de peau très robuste qui pourra résister aux basses températures en haute altitude.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_030:1"
msgid "Leather and canvas used to craft an airship bladder, we require! A simple task for a featherless one skilled as you, Yazel trusts."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ワシらは、ヒトの製作施設も抜かりなく調査ずみよッゥ！<br>ハーストミルという集落に作業しやすい設備があるッゥ。<br>「アメッタ」って女に設備を借りて、部材を仕上げてくれッェ！
#. de: In Mühlenhain geben gute Arbeitsstätte. Bei federlose Dametta. Khaa! Gehst du zu ihr und machst Bauteil, khaa!
#. fr: Et celui-ci connaît l'endroit idéal pour terminer cette mission en un rien de temps<nbsp>! Que <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> aille au Moulin des Bois pour demander à Dametta l'au<shy>to<shy>ri<shy>sa<shy>tion d'utiliser ses ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions. Il ne lui restera plus qu'à con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>ner l'objet en question.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
#. macro: <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_040:1"
msgid "A skilled <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> and listener both, Yazel hopes you are, for the aid of a featherless chatterbox, you require, to use these materials. Squa-hawk! For this component, the facilities of Dametta, you must utilize."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハーストミルで「<sheet Item "　8091" 0>」を作ってくれんかッァ！<br>「アメッタ」って女に設備を借りて、部材を仕上げてくれッェ！
#. de: Machst du in Mühlenhain <noun-de Item 2 "　8091" 1 4 1>, khaa. Dametta hat gute Arbeitsstätte.
#. fr: <if $gn4>Celle<else>Celui</if>-là a tout intérêt à utiliser les ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions d'artisanat du Moulin des Bois pour fabriquer <noun-fr Item 2 "　8091" 1 1> dont celui-ci a besoin. Sans oublier d'obtenir la permission de Dametta avant toute chose, bien sûr<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_050:1"
msgid "The ramblings of the chatterbox, you must endure, if to Yazel you wish to prove yourself able. Squa-hawk!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: この場所を仕事に使いたいって？<br>たしかに、どっしりした石作りの作業台もあるし、<br>手仕事にはもってこいさね。
#. de: Du möchtest meine Arbeitsstätte benutzen? Das kann ich gut verstehen. Der Steintisch ist robust und hat genau die richtige Höhe, um bequem im Stehen arbeiten zu können.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>, qu'est-ce qui vous amène<nbsp>? Ah, vous désirez utiliser nos ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions<nbsp>? C'est vrai que vous ne trouverez pas meilleur équipement pour pratiquer votre artisanat dans les environs...
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_060:1"
msgid "Oh my, you wish to use these facilities? They are lovely, aren't they? I do my utmost to keep them in tip-top condition, you know! Regular cleaning and maintenance is far more essential than most people realize."
msgstr ""

#. ja: お代がわりって言っちゃ何だけど、ひとつ頼まれておくれよ。<br>最近増えた「<sheet BNpcName 2984 0>」を退治してほしいんだ。<br>ムントゥイ豆を狙う、小汚い泥棒猿どもさ！
#. de: Kannst du mir vorher einen klitzekleinen Gefallen tun? Ein besonders hungriger Opo-Opo klaut mir sämtliche Bohnen aus der Vorratskammer. Bitte, leg dem Dieb das Handwerk!
#. fr: Ça n'est pas un problème, mais laissez-moi vous demander un petit service en échange. J'aimerais que vous donniez une bonne leçon à ces satanés <noun-fr BNpcName 12 2984 2 1> qui n'ont de cesse de voler nos fèves de Mun-Tuy<nbsp>!
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_061:1"
msgid "However, as much as I'd love to let you do so, I must ask that you do something in exchange. Worry not, it's nothing too difficult! Just a simple favor. I do have to clean up after you, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あいつら、エ・タッタ監視哨あたりが縄張りらしくてさ。<br>「<sheet EventItem 2001374 0>」を撒けば出てくると思うんだ。<br>退治の証拠に「<sheet EventItem 2001375 0>」を持ってきてよ！
#. de: Sein Revier liegt in der Nähe von E-Tatts Wachturm. An einer Reviermarkierung kannst du ihn mit reifen Mun-Tuy-Bohnen anlocken. Hier, ich geb dir einen Sack davon mit. Wenn du ihn erlegt hast, bring mir seine Klaue als Trophäe!
#. fr: Leur tanière se trouve du côté de la tour d'E-Tatt. Je suis prête à parier qu'ils baisseront leur garde si vous posez <noun-fr EventItem 1 2001374 1 1> à proximité... Une fois que vous en aurez fini, rapportez-moi <noun-fr EventItem 1 2001375 1 1> comme preuve de votre succès, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_062:1"
msgid "Know you of opo<hyphen>opos? Dreadful little scamps, always stealing my Mun<hyphen>Tuy beans. One in particular has given me no end of trouble, and I will suffer it no longer! Pray use these ripe beans to lure him out from his lair near E<hyphen>Tatt's Spire and end his reign of terror! And, though it's a grisly thing to ask, I must insist that you return with proof of the deed─a fang, or a claw, or something of that nature. Nothing too large, mind you. I don't want it as a trophy to hang on my wall. I'm not a monster!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet BNpcName 2984 0>」をおびき寄せるには、<br>エ・タッタ監視哨あたりで「<sheet EventItem 2001374 0>」を撒けばいい。<br>退治の証拠に「<sheet EventItem 2001375 0>」を持ってきてよ！
#. de: Wie du ihn anlocken kannst? Na, mit schön reifen Mun-Tuy-Bohnen natürlich! Ich hab dir doch einen Sack voll Bohnen mitgegeben. Vergiss nicht, mir <noun-de EventItem 2 2001375 1 4 1> als Trophäe zu bringen!
#. fr: Servez-vous de <noun-fr EventItem 6 2001374 1 1> pour attirer <noun-fr BNpcName 2 2984 2 1> dans une embuscade, et soyez sans pitié<nbsp>! Une fois le travail terminé, vous n'aurez qu'à m'apporter <noun-fr EventItem 1 2001375 1 1>.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_070:1"
msgid "Truth be told, I've no real desire to see proof of the deed. However, I've been deceived before─not to imply that you're a liar like <i>that</i> adventurer was, of course!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ところであんた、ヒマなのかい？<br>退治に向かう前に、ちょっと話につきあっておくれよ。<br>やぁね、すぐにすむわよ～。
#. de: Willst du gleich schon los? Oder hast du noch kurz Zeit für ein kleines Schwätzchen?
#. fr: Au fait, vous n'auriez pas une petite minute avant de partir à la chasse aux primates<nbsp>? J'ai une histoire à vous raconter.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_071:1"
msgid "You see, he came through the other day and, like you, he wished to use these facilities. I told him─as I told you─that I would gladly permit him to do so, if only he first dealt with a certain opo<hyphen>opo. So off he went for the better part of a day, eventually returning to report that the deed was done! Naturally, I was beside myself with joy, and I went to bed that night thinking that the opo<hyphen>opo was no more and all was right with the world."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ここは、森の恵みに満ちた最高の場所だからね……<br>この間、別の職人さんが…………………ときも……<br>……でもそれは…………さすがにどうかと…………
#. de: Ach, in Mühlenhain ist es ja so schön ... und die Gaben des Waldes ... Ach, ja, und die Mun-Tuy-Bohnen ... \<blablabla>
#. fr: Figurez-vous que l'autre jour, un artisan est venu me demander... (blablabla)... ce à quoi j'ai répondu... (blablabla)... non sans lui préciser que... (blablabla)...
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_072:1"
msgid "Needless to say, I was <i>very</i> cross when I awoke to find my stores pilfered yet again, and the ground stained with <i>copious</i> amounts of saliva─incontrovertible evidence that my sworn enemy yet lived! I made up my mind then and there to give that adventurer a piece of my mind─especially once I learned he had spent that afternoon <i>drinking in a pub</i> instead of tracking my opo<hyphen>opo."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そこでこっちも…………ムントゥイ豆を…………<br>そしたら…………煮すぎちゃったみたいでさ……<br>…………あんたも料理…………気をつけ…………
#. de: Dann habe ich natürlich sofort ... und überhaupt ... und noch mehr Mun-Tuy-Bohnen ...\<blablabla>
#. fr: Bien évidemment, il n'en a fait qu'à sa tête et... (blablabla)... fèves de Mun-Tuy... (blablabla)... trop fait cuire... (blablabla)... n'apprend pas à cuisiner du jour au lendemain... (blablabla)...
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_073:1"
msgid "But despite learning of his nefarious deeds, I never was able to track him down, which was surprising given how queer a fellow he was! He had <i>onions</i> tied to his belt, which I don't need to tell you is <i>very</i> unusual. When I asked him about them, he said it was the style at the time he was growing up, and he'd always had a fondness for his grandfather's ways..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アメッタの話は続いている……。
#. de: Dametta redet ... und redet ... und redet ...
#. fr: Dametta continue à raconter son histoire...
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_SYSTEM_100_073:1"
msgid "As Dametta struggles to recall if the onions were white or yellow, your mind begins to wander..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 敵の気配を感じた！！
#. de: Der hungrige Opo-Opo ist in deine Falle getappt!
#. fr: Vous ressentez une présence hostile<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_POP_MESSAGE:1"
msgid "The opo<hyphen>opo sprays saliva in your general direction!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet EventItem 2001375 0>」を持ってきたのかい？<br>だったら、この場所を使わせてあげなきゃね。<br>下準備をするから、持ち込んだ材料と一緒に貸してごらん。
#. de: Bringst du mir <noun-de EventItem 2 2001375 1 4 1>? Zeig doch mal her! Dann kannst du gerne meine Arbeitsstätte benutzen. Ach ja, gib mir auch das Material, dass du verarbeiten willst, damit ich alles vorbereiten kann.
#. fr: Alors, m'avez-vous apporté la preuve de votre carnage<nbsp>? Si vous me remettez <noun-fr EventItem 1 2001375 1 1>, je vous laisserai utiliser nos ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions d'artisanat à votre guise.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_090:1"
msgid "As I told you before, you are more than welcome to make use of these facilities─provided you deal with that dastardly opo<hyphen>opo first. Oh, and as a precaution, I must ask that you present your materials for inspection as well. You would be <i>shocked</i> by what some people have tried to make here!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おやまあ、ずいぶん多めに持ち込んだんだね？<br>かさばる袋は預かって、材料は製作に必要な分だけ返すよ。<br>あとはこの場所を、好きに使って製作するんだね！
#. de: Nicht schlecht! Das Material taugt etwas, keine Frage. Hier, nimm dir, so viel du brauchst. Den Rest verwahre ich für dich. Bitte, fang ruhig an! Die Arbeitsstätte ist bereit!
#. fr: Chose promise, chose due, vous pouvez utiliser nos équipements comme bon vous semble<nbsp>!
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_091:1"
msgid "My word, is that really... Oh gods, I can't bear to look at it! Take it from my sight and dispose of it─but not in the river! Now then, deep breaths... Though unusual, I don't believe your materials could be used for evil ends. Here you are. You'll note I didn't return them all─there are several times the required materials, it would seem. Whoever entrusted this task to you left a note in the bag: “To featherless neuker, give only required parts. In case of failure, retain spares.” Hmmm... What in the world is a “neuker”?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 材料が足りなくなったり、<br>またこの場所を使いたくなったら、声をかけてちょうだい。
#. de: Falls das Material nicht reicht oder du mit der Arbeitsstätte nicht zurechtkommst, dann frag mich einfach. Ich bin sicher, wir kriegen das hin.
#. fr: Si vous manquez de matériaux ou si vous voulez à nouveau travailler ici, n'hésitez pas à me le faire savoir.
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_000_100:1"
msgid "Oh, do you require more time with the facilities? By all means, take as long as you like! And if you require additional materials, let me know. I have plenty here for the “featherless neuker.”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 仕事は終わったみたいだから、早く納品に行きなよ！<br>製作した品をなくしたりして、また作りなおすときは、<br>声をかけておくれ。
#. de: Na, bist du fertig mit der Arbeit? Dann lass deinen Auftraggeber nicht länger warten! Falls du den Gegenstand verlieren solltest und neu anfertigen musst, kannst du dich gerne wieder bei mir melden.
#. fr: Ça y est, vous avez fabriqué ce que vous vouliez<nbsp>? Si j'étais vous, je ne ferais pas attendre davantage mon commanditaire. Au cas où vous perdriez votre précieuse marchandise, faites-moi signe<nbsp>!
#. speaker: DAMETTA
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_DAMETTA_100_100:1"
msgid "Is that the finished product? I...I have no idea what that is, but it looks splendid! I'm sure your client will love it! Ah─it so happens there was another note in the bag: “Retain spare parts, in case featherless neuker loses component en route.” He really doesn't trust you, does he?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: どうだッァ？<br>「<sheet Item "　8091" 0>」は作ってきてくれたかッァ……？
#. de: Khaa, wie sieht aus? Bringst du mir <noun-de Item 2 "　8091" 1 4 1>?
#. fr: Ah, <if $gn4>celle<else>celui</if>-là est de retour<nbsp>! A-t-<if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> réussi à fabriquer <noun-fr Item 2 "　8091" 1 1> que celui-ci lui avait commandé<nbsp>?
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
#. macro: <if $gn4>herself<else>himself</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_130:1"
msgid "Squahaha! Returned, the one who would prove <if $gn4>herself<else>himself</if> able is! Bladder component, <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> has brought?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: おおッォ……感謝感激じゃッァ！<br><if $gn4>ネエチャン<else>アンチャン</if>は世界いち……<br>いや、親方の次にエエお方じゃッァ！
#. de: Danke, khaa! Wirklich nett für <if $gn4>eine Federlose<else>einen Federlosen</if>! Fast so großartig wie Große Schwinge!
#. fr: Oui, c'est exactement ça<nbsp>! Il n'y a pas de doute, <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> est <if $gn4>la meilleure<else>le meilleur</if><nbsp>! Enfin, après oncle Sezul, bien évidemment.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_131:1"
msgid "...Squa-hawk! Able indeed, featherless one is! Within you lies great potential, as Chief Totoloc said."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 身寄りのないワシを拾ってくれた親方にやっと報いられる……<br>親方の、ワシら空力団の夢に、また一歩近づけたわッァ！<br>うぅッゥ、涙ちょちょぎれそうじゃッァ……！
#. de: Hat mich Große Schwinge aufgenommen, als ich ganz allein war. Jetzt wir leben für Traum vom Fliegen. Bringst du uns einen Schritt weiter, khaa! Mir kommen Tränen, khaa ...
#. fr: Celui-ci a tant attendu ce jour, depuis qu'oncle Sezul a eu l'immense bonté de le recueillir... Quand celui-ci va lui annoncer que ceux-ci vont se rapprocher de leur rêve, il sera tellement fier<nbsp>! Celui-ci en a les larmes aux yeux...
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_YAZELAHUATAN_000_132:1"
msgid "Potential in Yazel too, the chief once saw. Not wrong in either case, it is more than clear to me! Squawk!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作の準備が整った。
#. de: Die Arbeitsstätte steht dir jetzt zur Verfügung.
#. fr: Vous pouvez maintenant utiliser les installations d'artisanat.
#. speaker: POPMESSAGE
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa101_01494:TEXT_BANIXA101_01494_POPMESSAGE_000_200:1"
msgid "You now have access to the crafting facility."
msgstr ""
